   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「私、達、かも」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:241600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あたし達？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:241700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……ううん、違う、かも」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:241800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「拓留先輩の気持ちを利用しているのは――」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:241900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「――わたし、かも」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……ふう」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そうね。その通り」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「宮代先輩の気持ちを利用しているのは、あたし達じゃなくて、あんた。あんただけよ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「確かにあたしは宮代先輩とできるだけ長くデートがしたい。キスがしたい。できるんだったら処女だって捧げたい」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「でもね、分かってるんでしょう？ あたしがどうしてそんなに宮代先輩が好きなのか」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……ん」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……それ、は。わたしが望んでいるから、かも」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:242900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そうよ、あんたが望んでるから、あたしはここにいる」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:243000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「引っ込み思案で、コミュ障で、おまけに厄介な能力のおかげで喋ることもママならないあんたの代わりにここにいるの」"
  },
